sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 玩家(手势)
    participant ST as store.ts
    participant SV as server.ts(ServerFn)
    participant CH as chains.ts(echoChain)
    participant LLM as AI PING(DeepSeek)

    U->>ST: Orbit 拖情绪 token → fingerprintOf
    U->>ST: Mirror 认领 → selectedMirror
    U->>ST: Compose chips → letter
    ST->>ST: agentPayload() 打包 NightInput
    ST->>SV: runMatch(payload)  [22s race]
    SV->>CH: echoChain.match(asNight)
    CH->>CH: researchStep(search_cases + search_archive)
    CH->>LLM: decidePersona(仅 arrive 工具)
    CH->>LLM: writeGreeting(零工具，≤28 字)
    CH->>CH: validate(ownLine/stolenVoice/foreignPlace)
    CH-->>SV: NightResult{echo, greeting, suggestions, hits}
    SV-->>ST: MatchResult
    ST-->>U: 进入 Encounter，展示回声第一句 + 建议卡
    loop 每轮对话（≤3 轮）
        U->>ST: reply(一句)
        ST->>SV: runTurn(payload)  [12s]
        SV->>CH: echoChain.turn
        CH->>CH: researchStep
        CH->>LLM: rememberPlayer(仅 remember 工具)
        CH->>LLM: reply(仅 arrive 工具)
        CH->>CH: validate
        CH-->>ST: TurnResult{spoken, suggestions}
    end
    U->>ST: 第 3 轮 → seal
    ST->>SV: runSeal  [14s]
    SV->>CH: echoChain.seal → writeReturnLetter(零工具，≤48 字)
    CH-->>ST: SealResult{returnLetter, facts}
    ST->>ST: saveReturn()：keepPlayerFacts + applyFacts 写回信柜
    ST-->>U: 归档；这段记忆下次旅程被 search_archive 引用
